    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** The company faces severe demand contraction, with service volumes plunging after the loss of a major customer and reduced miner eligibility for colocation and energy management services. This exposes high customer concentration and vulnerability to crypto-mining sector dynamics. While the top‑line shrank dramatically, revenue still edged past subdued market forecasts, reflecting a very low bar.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Management executed a stark turnaround, swinging from loss to profit and handily beating dismal expectations, largely through aggressive cost containment. This shows effective crisis management. However, the profit improvement was achieved on a sharply lower revenue base following the loss of a key customer, raising doubts about whether the cost cuts can sustain earnings growth or offset the need for new business development.",
